                                                </ul>
                                            </td>
                                            <td>We accept the proposal above and I have read and understand the Terms and Conditions of Service provided by CARE, and agree to abide by them. I include with this acceptance the bank guarantee or registered cheque.</td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </tbody>
                                </table>
